OL,3,ARussia targeting 'ordinary life' with
OL,4,Aattacks on Ukraine's data centres,
OL,5,AZelensky says
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky says
OL,8,FRussia has widened its attacks to
OL,9,Ftarget Ukraine's data centres and
OL,10,Finternet providers, seeking to cause
OL,11,Fmaximum disruption for ordinary people.
OL,13,F"All this affects people's ability to
OL,14,Fstay connected, study, work," he said.
OL,16,FOn Friday a Russian drone hit a
OL,17,Fbusiness centre in the capital Kyiv,
OL,18,Fkilling four people and damaging a data
OL,19,Fcentre. A separate attack killed a
OL,20,F14-year-old boy. Israel's foreign
OL,21,Fministry said he was an Israeli
OL,22,Fcitizen.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
